189	    /**
190	     * Handles {@link InvalidTelephoneException} raised on create when the supplied telephone does
191	     * not normalize to exactly 10 digits. Returns a 400 Bad Request whose body carries an
192	     * {@code errors} array naming the {@code telephone} field.
193	     *
